[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19680.948, "timestamp": "05:28:00", "text": "physical. It was in his past. And no"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19683.35, "timestamp": "05:28:03", "text": "matter how fast he was driving, he"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19685.948, "timestamp": "05:28:05", "text": "couldn't get out of it."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19689.708, "timestamp": "05:28:09", "text": "Guilt is a dangerous"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19695.07, "timestamp": "05:28:15", "text": "feeling. It was eating him for a few"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19699.47, "timestamp": "05:28:19", "text": "years. So he was driving"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19702.868, "timestamp": "05:28:22", "text": "away from the big city. He needed some"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19707.31, "timestamp": "05:28:27", "text": "time on his horn. The state of V"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19709.43, "timestamp": "05:28:29", "text": "Wisconsin proved to be an excellent"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19711.99, "timestamp": "05:28:31", "text": "choice for him. Jake's late parents had"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19715.59, "timestamp": "05:28:35", "text": "a cabin somewhere not in the woods. He"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19717.59, "timestamp": "05:28:37", "text": "was heading in the in that direction in"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19720.11, "timestamp": "05:28:40", "text": "order to escape for a few"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19724.23, "timestamp": "05:28:44", "text": "days. Sleepiness crawled over over him"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19728.15, "timestamp": "05:28:48", "text": "and he had a hard time concentrating on"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19730.708, "timestamp": "05:28:50", "text": "the road. He was driving for many hours"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19734.948, "timestamp": "05:28:54", "text": "now. Driving was also a thing he loved."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19738.83, "timestamp": "05:28:58", "text": "love long story. Long roads were his"